The present writ petition has been filed by the petitioners with the following reliefs:-
Dr. Anoop Bhalla (Ifs)(Retd) vs Union Of India on 25 July, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/27585897/
1 " Hon'ble Court be pleased to issue a Writ/Order/Direction in the nature of mandamus to (i) call for recommendations for protection, prevention and safety of elephants in view of human elephant conflict in Chhattisgarh;
(ii) issue guidelines for the tracking of Elephants in order to save them from the threat of extinction and cruelty against them;

(v) issue guidelines for the creation of scientific/alternative measures and its implementation by the Respondents to ward off wild animals which may prove danger to the standing crops and human settlements;
(vi)direct the Respondent No.1 to constitute a team to reinvestigate into all the deaths of elephants in the state by electrocution, poisoning;
(vii)pass any other order as this Hon'ble Court deems fit/proper."
2. Learned counsel for petitioners submits that petitioners by way of this petition, are making prayer to direct authorities to re-investigate the deaths of elephants caused in the State in the year 2019-2020, by forming a special team.
